# Deep Sea Electronics generator controllers, GenComm protocol.
# Address = page * 256 + offset (page numbers from the GenComm spec).
# Monitoring map: read-only. Control registers (page 16, start/stop/mode)
# are left out on purpose; writing them operates the generator.
# Sentinels: 0xFFFF / 0x7FFF (16-bit) and 0xFFFFFFFF / 0x7FFFFFFF (32-bit) mean
# unimplemented; values just below them mean over/under range, sensor fault,
# bad data. RS485 is 8N2, except the 73xx family, which uses 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Deep Sea Electronics
@model=GenComm controllers
@description=DSE generator controllers (72xx/73xx/74xx/8xxx families) over the GenComm Modbus protocol. 3xx transfer switches use another layout for pages 6 and 7
@source=Deep Sea Electronics, "GenComm standard for use with generating set control equipment" v2.14 (2012-04-16); later revision reproduced in Winco SP-228 Rev A (https://www.wincogen.com/wp-content/uploads/PD/Spec_Sheets/Accessories/SP-228_%20DSE7310-GENCOMM.pdf)
@protocol=tcp+rtu
@parity=N
@databits=8
@stopbits=2
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@max_read_registers=125
@enum_control_mode=0=Stop|1=Auto|2=Manual|3=Test on load|4=Auto, manual restore|5=User configuration|6=Test off load|7=Off
@enum_phase_rotation=0=Indeterminate|1=L1-L2-L3|2=L3-L2-L1|3=Phase error

name,group,area,address,type,length,scale,offset,unit,access,byte_order,bit,enum,description
# Page 3 - generating set status (base 768)
Manufacturer code,Status,holding,768,uint16,,,,,R,,,,
Model number,Status,holding,769,uint16,,,,,R,,,,
Serial number,Status,holding,770,uint32,,,,,R,,,,
Control mode,Status,holding,772,uint16,,,,,R,,,@control_mode,Off (7) was added after GenComm 2.14
Control unit not configured,Status,holding,774,bool,,,,,R,,15,,
Control unit failure,Status,holding,774,bool,,,,,R,,13,,
Shutdown alarm active,Status,holding,774,bool,,,,,R,,12,,
Electrical trip alarm active,Status,holding,774,bool,,,,,R,,11,,
Warning alarm active,Status,holding,774,bool,,,,,R,,10,,
Telemetry alarm,Status,holding,774,bool,,,,,R,,9,,
Controlled shutdown alarm active,Status,holding,774,bool,,,,,R,,6,,Added after GenComm 2.14
